{%- comment -%}
  ci-header.liquid — sticky storefront header.
  Nav: Shop (dropdown: All Shelves · Roccia · Sorpresa · Selezione · Offerta) · Bottega · Roasters · Journal · About
  Right: cart · sign-in. SPA navigation handled by ci-storefront.js (showPage).
  (Search removed in POC9 - the icon promised a search field but only routed to Shop;
  real site-wide search returns at production via Shopify native predictive search.)
{%- endcomment -%}
<header class="ci-header">
  <div class="flag-strip flag-top" aria-hidden="true"><div></div><div></div><div></div></div>
  <div class="header-inner">
    <img class="ci-logo" src="{{ 'ci-logo.png' | asset_url }}" alt="Crema Italia" width="146" height="44"
         onclick="showPage('home')">
    {%- comment -%}
      POC16: mobile-only quick actions. On desktop Shop and the cart live in
      .header-right; below the mobile breakpoint that whole block collapses into the
      hamburger panel, which left the 62px bar carrying nothing but a logo and a
      hamburger - 153px of it measurably empty - and put the cart two taps away.
      A visitor arriving cold on a phone had no signal above the fold that this is a
      shop at all, and a customer with a full cart had no visible way back to it.
      Shop routes STRAIGHT to the all-shelves page rather than opening a submenu:
      a second menu system running beside the hamburger panel is the real risk here,
      not the two extra elements.
    {%- endcomment -%}
    <div class="header-quick">
      <button class="hq-btn hq-shop" onclick="showPage('shop')">Shop</button>
      <button class="hq-btn hq-cart" aria-label="Cart" onclick="showPage('cart')">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M6 6h15l-1.5 9h-12z"></path><circle cx="9" cy="20" r="1.4"></circle><circle cx="18" cy="20" r="1.4"></circle><path d="M6 6 5 3H2"></path></svg>
        <span class="cart-count">0</span>
      </button>
    </div>
    <button class="hamburger" id="hamburger" aria-label="Menu" aria-haspopup="true" aria-expanded="false"
            aria-controls="header-right" onclick="toggleMobileMenu()">
      <span class="ham-bars" aria-hidden="true"><span></span><span></span><span></span></span>
    </button>
    <div class="header-right" id="header-right">
      <nav aria-label="Primary">
        <div class="nav-item">
          <button onclick="showPage('shop');closeShopMenu()" id="nav-shop" aria-haspopup="true">Shop</button>
          <div class="shop-menu" role="menu">
            <a role="menuitem" tabindex="0" onclick="showPage('shop');closeShopMenu()"><span class="lbl">All Shelves</span><span class="men">Every coffee we carry, in one place.</span></a>
            <div class="shop-div" role="separator"></div>
            <a role="menuitem" tabindex="0" onclick="showPage('roccia');closeShopMenu()"><span class="ita">Roccia</span><span class="men">The Rock: our rock-solid subscription plan.</span></a>
            <a role="menuitem" tabindex="0" onclick="showPage('sorpresa');closeShopMenu()"><span class="ita">Sorpresa</span><span class="men">The Surprise: our curated collections of roasted delights.</span></a>
            <a role="menuitem" tabindex="0" onclick="showPage('selezione');closeShopMenu()"><span class="ita">Selezione</span><span class="men">The Selection: roasters' premium and seasonal offerings.</span></a>
            <a role="menuitem" tabindex="0" onclick="showPage('offerta');closeShopMenu()"><span class="ita">Offerta</span><span class="men">The Offer: limited-time offers, on sale while inventory lasts.</span></a>
          </div>
        </div>
        <button onclick="showPage('bottega')" id="nav-bottega">Bottega</button>
        <button onclick="showPage('roasters')" id="nav-roasters">Roasters</button>
        <button onclick="showPage('journal')" id="nav-journal">Journal</button>
        <button onclick="showPage('about')" id="nav-about">About</button>
      </nav>
      <button class="icon-btn" title="Cart" aria-label="Cart" onclick="showPage('cart')" style="position:relative">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M6 6h15l-1.5 9h-12z"></path><circle cx="9" cy="20" r="1.4"></circle><circle cx="18" cy="20" r="1.4"></circle><path d="M6 6 5 3H2"></path></svg>
        <span class="btn-label">Cart</span>
        <span class="cart-count" id="cart-count">0</span>
      </button>
      <div class="account-wrap" id="account-wrap">
        <button class="sign-in-btn" id="signin-btn" onclick="handleAccountClick()"><span id="signin-label">Sign In</span></button>
        <div class="account-menu" role="menu">
          <a role="menuitem" tabindex="0" onclick="showPage('account');closeAccountMenu()">Account</a>
          <a role="menuitem" tabindex="0" onclick="showSubscriptions();closeAccountMenu()">Subscriptions</a>
          <a role="menuitem" tabindex="0" onclick="signOut();closeAccountMenu()">Sign out</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</header>
